     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><h4><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"arial, helvetica, clean, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">Hi</span></font></h4><h4><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"arial, helvetica, clean, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">I want to reproduce this picture, how can I organize the R code?</span></font></h4></div><div><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"arial, helvetica, clean, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\"><br></span></font></div><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><img src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/r-inla-discussion-group/attach/14310032319a52/Snipaste_2019-01-17_15-52-05.png?part=0.1&amp;view=1\" alt=\"Snipaste_2019-01-17_15-52-05.png\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" title=\"\"></p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\">In fact, this image is from an article<a href=\"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/abs/pii/S1877584512000846\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/abs/pii/S1877584512000846&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792442595436000&amp;usg=AOvVaw19XtRv7WA-B13yPYcuL9LN\">《Spatial and spatio-temporal models with R-INLA》</a></p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\">And I can&#39;t get access his code T_T.<br></p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align:left;clear:both\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:arial,helvetica,clean,sans-serif\">Thanks any help！</span><br></p><div style=\"text-align:center\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"arial, helvetica, clean, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\"><br></span></font></div></div>"
    ]
